404
00:37:57,529 --> 00:38:08,959
To- Today, we spoke about we speak about Open AI, Anthropic, but we also talk about the incredible Meta's Muse, Grok, Bot, and of course, Gemini.
今天，我们谈论 OpenAI、Anthropic，但也谈到了令人惊叹的 Meta Muse、Grok、Bot，当然还有 Gemini。

405
00:38:09,009 --> 00:38:13,790
