And then, very importantly, and this is ultimately the most important, for AI to succeed,
而且，非常重要的是，这最终也是最关键的一点，人工智能要成功，

407
00:38:20,240 --> 00:38:26,030
for Europe to benefit from AI and to have really created an AI ecosystem and AI economy,
欧洲要从人工智能中获益，并真正建立起人工智能生态系统和人工智能经济，

408
00:38:26,080 --> 00:38:32,067
you need all of the end markets, the end industries to adopt AI and to succeed with AI.
你需要所有终端市场和终端行业采用人工智能并借助人工智能取得成功。

409
00:38:32,117 --> 00:38:36,059
Whether it's in the automotive industry because we're building self-driving cars,
无论是汽车工业，因为我们正在打造自动驾驶汽车，

410
00:38:36,109 --> 00:38:42,310
or the way you manufacture with robotics, the way you discover new drugs in healthcare,
还是通过机器人进行制造，或是医疗健康领域中发现新药，

411
00:38:42,360 --> 00:38:52,024
your financial services in inst industry, all of these different industries have to become AI companies, every single one of them.
金融服务业在金融科技领域，所有这些不同行业都必须转型为AI公司，每一个都是如此。

412
00:38:52,074 --> 00:38:58,957
Well, we have a unique ability through what I just mentioned about CUDA and the way that we build computers,
事实上，正如我刚才提到的CUDA以及我们构建计算机的方式，

413
00:38:59,007 --> 00:39:07,950
we have a unique ability to serve literally every single segment of AI.
我们具备独一无二的能力，可以服务于AI的每一个细分领域。

414
00:39:08,000 --> 00:39:11,790
And so, one architecture, many markets.
因此，一套架构，覆盖多个市场。

415
00:39:11,840 --> 00:39:20,010
And because these infrastructure are so significant and so expensive, we need to make sure that they're as productive as possible,
由于这些基础设施极其重要且成本高昂，我们必须确保它们能尽快实现最大生产力，

416
00:39:20,060 --> 00:39:28,790
as soon as possible, that they're fungible, that you can use it for every workload from the beginning of your AI journey,
具备通用性，从你AI旅程的起点开始，就能用于各种工作负载，

417
00:39:28,840 --> 00:39:36,796
data processing to training to post-training, inference and agentic processing, every single step of the AI journey,
从数据处理、训练、训练后处理、推理到代理式处理，AI旅程的每一步，

418
00:39:36,846 --> 00:39:44,979
to every type of AI, chemicals and physics to languages to every single industry and the algorithms that they use.
适用于各类AI，从化学与物理到语言，再到每个行业以及它们所使用的算法。

419
00:39:45,029 --> 00:39:54,310
And so, NVIDIA's architecture is fungible and as result of that, continuous innovation, continuous updating of software.
因此，英伟达的架构具备通用性，从而实现了持续创新和软件的持续更新。

420
00:39:54,360 --> 00:39:59,156
Because the installed base is so great, we have such an incredibly rich ecosystem of software,
正因为已有庞大的部署基础，我们才拥有如此丰富而强大的软件生态系统，

421
00:39:59,206 --> 00:40:05,110
then these architectures also durable, fungible, durable, productive.
那些架构同样具备耐用性、可替代性、持久性和生产力。

422
00:40:05,160 --> 00:40:08,550
Well, that lays the foundation.
这就奠定了基础。

423
00:40:08,600 --> 00:40:10,134
That is the infrastructure.
这就是基础设施。

424
00:40:10,184 --> 00:40:12,430
Now, what do we do with it?
那么，我们接下来该怎么做？

425
00:40:12,480 --> 00:40:15,369
This last year, we saw a transition in AI.
去年，我们见证了人工智能的转型。

426
00:40:15,419 --> 00:40:24,950
AI is now productive and it's one of the most important times was in the beginning of the year when we spoke about Open Claw,
人工智能现在已具备生产力，今年初我们谈到 Open Claw 时，正是最关键的时刻，

427
00:40:25,000 --> 00:40:32,430
which introduced the concept of an open-source agent, and it really started what we all see across the world today.
它引入了开源代理的概念，真正开启了今天我们全球所见的这一趋势。

428
00:40:32,480 --> 00:40:42,350
Agents think, reason, iterate, use tools, and as a result, consume an enormous amount of tokens.
代理能够思考、推理、迭代、使用工具，因此消耗了大量词元。

429
00:40:42,400 --> 00:40:44,913
But as a result, they become useful.
但正因如此，它们变得真正有用。

430
00:40:44,963 --> 00:40:50,932
So, more agents are being developed, they're more useful, and they're and therefore they're used by more people,
因此，更多代理正在被开发，它们更加有用，也因此被更多人使用，

431
00:40:50,982 --> 00:40:57,381
and because they have to use a lot of tokens to think, the amount of token consumption has gone through the roof.
而由于它们需要大量词元来思考，词元消耗量急剧上升。

432
00:40:57,431 --> 00:41:00,070
GPU demand has really gone through the roof.
GPU 需求也急剧上升。

433
00:41:00,120 --> 00:41:02,275
Now, what's processing it is this.
现在，真正处理它的是这个。

434
00:41:02,325 --> 00:41:04,310
This is an agent.
这是一个智能体。

435
00:41:04,360 --> 00:41:06,550
These are the five elements of an agent.
这是智能体的五个要素。

436
00:41:06,600 --> 00:41:09,910
The first part are the language models.
第一部分是语言模型。

437
00:41:09,960 --> 00:41:19,830
These are the tokens that are running on top of the GPUs, and they're generating tokens that are consumed by the agent, what I I call the exoskeleton.
这些是在 GPU 上运行的词元，它们生成的词元由智能体消耗，我称之为“外骨骼”。

438
00:41:19,880 --> 00:41:27,310
That Open Claw harness sits inside a sandbox, and that sandbox isolates it from the rest of the system.
这个开放爪形夹具被置于沙箱中，沙箱将其与系统其余部分隔离。

439
00:41:27,360 --> 00:41:30,590
This is a very important concept that we're going to come back to.
这是一个非常重要的概念，我们稍后会再回来讨论。

440
00:41:30,640 --> 00:41:31,694
There are five things.
有五个要素。

441
00:41:31,744 --> 00:41:41,870
There's the model, there's the harness, the sandbox that the harness sits in, and two other things, knowledge and tools.
有模型，有夹具，夹具所在的沙箱，还有另外两个要素：知识和工具。

442
00:41:41,920 --> 00:41:46,366
Models, sandbox, harness, knowledge, and tools.
模型、沙箱、夹具、知识和工具。

443
00:41:46,416 --> 00:41:49,925
These are the five elements of an agent.
这是智能体的五个要素。

444
00:41:49,975 --> 00:41:58,350
Now, before I talk about how to make the agents useful, the most important thing is we have to make sure that the agent is secure.
现在，在讨论如何让智能体有用之前，最重要的是我们必须确保智能体是安全的。

445
00:41:58,400 --> 00:41:59,926
The agent is autonomous.
该代理是自主的。

446
00:41:59,976 --> 00:42:06,950
It's an autonomous system that has access to files, has access to resources, networks, access to tools,
它是一个自主系统，能够访问文件、资源、网络和工具。

447
00:42:07,000 --> 00:42:14,830
and we need to make sure that the privileges that we provide this autonomous system is minimal.
我们必须确保提供给这个自主系统的权限是最小化的。

448
00:42:14,880 --> 00:42:17,990
And that we constantly monitor it.
并且我们需要持续监控它。

449
00:42:18,040 --> 00:42:25,270
We introduced a fantastic new product, a new platform, and it's called Open Shell.
我们推出了一款非常出色的新产品，一个新平台，名为 Open Shell。

450
00:42:25,320 --> 00:42:27,340
Open Shell came just in time.
Open Shell 正好及时推出。

451
00:42:27,390 --> 00:42:32,590
This is a secure runtime that provides for the things that I just mentioned.
这是一个安全的运行时环境，能够实现我刚才提到的所有功能。

452
00:42:32,640 --> 00:42:36,853
And has an additional hardware-based monitor.
并且还配备了一个基于硬件的监控器。

453
00:42:36,903 --> 00:42:44,070
Before I explain it to you, let's watch a video.
在我向你们解释之前，我们先看一段视频。

454
00:42:44,120 --> 00:42:47,734
Enterprises are preparing to deploy billions of AI agents.
企业正准备部署数十亿个 AI 代理。

455
00:42:47,784 --> 00:42:54,910
To be useful, they'll reason, plan, use tools, access data, and work together.
为了有用，它们将进行推理、规划、使用工具、访问数据并协同工作。

456
00:42:54,960 --> 00:42:59,901
Today, the only thing stopping an agent from misusing all that is asking it nicely.
如今，唯一阻止代理滥用这些能力的，就是礼貌地请求它。

457
00:42:59,951 --> 00:43:01,965
Please don't delete anything.
请不要删除任何内容。

458
00:43:02,015 --> 00:43:03,950
Please don't push to main.
请不要推送到主分支。

459
00:43:04,000 --> 00:43:06,590
Please don't touch my SSH keys.
请不要碰我的 SSH 密钥。

460
00:43:06,640 --> 00:43:11,190
That's the please don't approach, but hope isn't security.
这就是“请不要接近”的态度，但希望不是安全的保障。

461
00:43:11,240 --> 00:43:13,192
Safety isn't an aspiration.
安全不是一种愿望。

462
00:43:13,242 --> 00:43:15,590
It's technology and engineering.
这是技术与工程。

463
00:43:15,640 --> 00:43:19,830
Nvidia Open Shell and Sentry put that philosophy into practice.
英伟达 Open Shell 和 Sentry 将这一理念付诸实践。

464
00:43:19,880 --> 00:43:30,030
You write a policy for what each agent can touch, and Open Shell enforces it at the granularity of system calls, file access, and network connections.
你为每个代理可操作的范围编写策略，Open Shell 会在系统调用、文件访问和网络连接的粒度上强制执行。

465
00:43:30,080 --> 00:43:34,690
Formal verification checks every policy change against your permission ceiling.
形式化验证会将每项策略变更与你的权限上限进行比对。

466
00:43:34,740 --> 00:43:38,350
So, agents never gain more access than intended.
因此，代理永远不会获得超出预期的权限。

467
00:43:38,400 --> 00:43:40,371
It's like the early internet.
就像早期的互联网。

468
00:43:40,421 --> 00:43:46,870
Viruses were everywhere until browsers enforced strict limits on what a webpage could do.
病毒泛滥，直到浏览器对网页能执行的操作施加了严格限制。

469
00:43:46,920 --> 00:43:49,350
Open Shell does the same for agents.
Open Shell 为代理提供了同样的保护。

470
00:43:49,400 --> 00:43:57,790
Enforcement happens outside the agent, not just in LLM guardrails, bringing agent native security into your infrastructure.
安全管控发生在代理之外，而不仅限于大模型防护机制，将原生代理安全融入你的基础设施。

471
00:43:57,840 --> 00:44:04,150
Every agent runs inside its own isolated sandbox with no direct route to the network.
每个代理都在独立的隔离沙箱中运行，无法直接访问网络。

472
00:44:04,200 --> 00:44:08,798
Every outbound network request goes through the supervisor outside the sandbox.
所有出站网络请求均需经过沙箱外的监督者。

473
00:44:08,848 --> 00:44:11,454
It checks the action against your policy.
监督者会将操作与你的策略进行比对。

474
00:44:11,504 --> 00:44:14,430
If it's not permitted, it's denied.
若不符合许可条件，则予以拒绝。

475
00:44:14,480 --> 00:44:20,143
Keys stay outside with the supervisor and are added only on the way to an approved endpoint.
密钥始终保留在监督者处，仅在通往已批准端点时才被添加。

476
00:44:20,193 --> 00:44:23,790
A compromised agent can't leak a key it never had.
即使代理被攻破，也无法泄露它从未拥有的密钥。

477
00:44:23,840 --> 00:44:26,350
The gateway is the control plane.
网关即控制平面。

478
00:44:26,400 --> 00:44:28,474
The supervisor makes the decisions.
监督者负责做出决策。

479
00:44:28,524 --> 00:44:35,790
The sandbox holds the agent and the policy prover checks proposed policies against your permission ceilings.
沙箱容纳代理，策略验证器会将拟议策略与你的权限上限进行核对。

480
00:44:35,840 --> 00:44:41,070
Open Shell combines Linux kernel isolation with runtime policy enforcement.
Open Shell 结合了 Linux 内核隔离与运行时策略强制执行。

481
00:44:41,120 --> 00:44:48,270
Nvidia Sentry adds an optional layer of protection outside the host itself, away from the agent.
英伟达Sentry在主机外部增加了一层可选保护，远离代理本身。

482
00:44:48,320 --> 00:44:57,070
Running on Nvidia BlueField 4, Sentry monitors agent activity and enforces security policies in a hardware isolated trust domain.
在英伟达BlueField 4上运行，Sentry在硬件隔离的信任域中监控代理活动并执行安全策略。

483
00:44:57,120 --> 00:45:02,874
Because agent reasoning traffic passes through Sentry, if the agent is planning to do something unintended,
由于代理推理流量需经过Sentry，若代理计划执行非预期操作，

484
00:45:02,924 --> 00:45:09,590
it will update policies immediately and cut the connection to the model, quarantining it in milliseconds.
系统将立即更新策略并切断与模型的连接，毫秒级隔离该代理。

485
00:45:09,640 --> 00:45:16,870
And it keeps tamper evident records that operators can verify for detection, investigation, and response.
同时保留可被验证的防篡改记录，供操作人员用于检测、调查和响应。

486
00:45:16,920 --> 00:45:26,070
Open Shell is open source under Apache 2.0, runs everywhere your agents do, edge to cloud, and takes two commands to adopt.
Open Shell采用Apache 2.0开源协议，可在代理运行的任何地方运行，从边缘到云，并且只需两条命令即可部署。

487
00:45:26,120 --> 00:45:30,990
Install the CLI, create a sandbox, and run your favorite agent.
安装CLI，创建沙箱，运行你最喜欢的代理。

488
00:45:31,040 --> 00:45:34,190
Agents are only as useful as the access you give them.
代理的实用性取决于你赋予它们的访问权限。

489
00:45:34,240 --> 00:45:37,710
Open Shell and Sentry put that access under your control.
Open Shell和Sentry将这些访问权限置于你的控制之下。

490
00:45:37,760 --> 00:45:38,961
That's how we advance
这就是我们推动

491
00:45:39,011 --> 00:45:39,870
AI capabilities
AI能力

492
00:45:39,920 --> 00:45:51,630
and safety together.
与安全同步发展的途径。

493
00:45:51,680 --> 00:45:53,283
Agents are autonomous systems.
代理是自主系统。

494
00:45:53,333 --> 00:46:03,550
We have to create extremely secure technology to make sure that we could develop these agents and deploy these agents safely.
我们必须创建极其安全的技术，以确保我们能够安全地开发和部署这些代理。

495
00:46:03,600 --> 00:46:04,656
Now, it's incredible.
现在，这简直令人难以置信。

496
00:46:04,706 --> 00:46:13,390
After announcing Open Shell, just about every major company in the world, from the frontier labs to the operating system companies,
在宣布 Open Shell 之后，全球几乎所有主要公司，从前沿实验室到操作系统公司，

497
00:46:13,440 --> 00:46:18,102
cybersecurity companies, platform companies have come out to adopt Open Shell.
网络安全公司和平台公司都纷纷表态采用 Open Shell。

498
00:46:18,152 --> 00:46:19,793
It's really fantastic to see.
看到这一点真是令人振奋。

499
00:46:19,843 --> 00:46:23,501
And the reason for that is because this technology has arrived at exactly the right time.
原因在于，这项技术恰好在最合适的时机到来。

500
00:46:23,551 --> 00:46:26,429
At a time when we want to deploy agents all over the world.
正是我们希望在全球范围内部署代理的时刻。

501
00:46:26,479 --> 00:46:33,680
Now, remember, this isn't just about the services using Open Shell as they deploy agents.
请记住，这不仅仅关乎使用 Open Shell 部署代理的服务。

502
00:46:33,730 --> 00:46:38,625
This is really about all of the world's companies also adopting Open Shell so
这真正关乎全球所有公司也采用 Open Shell，以便

503
00:46:38,675 --> 00:46:43,522
that you could receive these agents and have them run autonomously inside your company.
你能够接收这些代理，并让它们在你的公司内部自主运行。

504
00:46:43,572 --> 00:46:52,610
Every single level of capability, every single task that you give the agent, for every person that uses the agent,
无论代理的每项能力层级，你交给代理的每项任务，以及每位使用代理的人，

505
00:46:52,660 --> 00:46:59,550
every one of those combinations requires a different level of privilege that you would provide to the agent.
每一种组合都需要为代理提供不同级别的权限。

506
00:46:59,600 --> 00:47:03,950
And every single time that an agent is launched, the privileges are different.
每次启动代理时，权限都会不同。

507
00:47:04,000 --> 00:47:11,584
And so, privileges, the policy enforcement, the monitoring, all has to be done dynamically.
因此，权限管理、策略执行和监控都必须动态完成。

508
00:47:11,634 --> 00:47:14,503
And so, Open Shell is really revolutionary.
所以，Open Shell 真正具有革命性。

509
00:47:14,553 --> 00:47:21,054
I'm delighted to say that Anthropic and Nvidia are partnering to create Claude Open Shell agents.
我很高兴地宣布，Anthropic 和英伟达正在合作开发 Claude Open Shell 代理。

510
00:47:21,104 --> 00:47:22,869
And so, you can go to the website.
你可以访问该网站。

511
00:47:22,919 --> 00:47:25,214
There's a really great write-up about that.
